oposals/issues/909\r\n\r\nAdds advanced breakpoints and related editor features to work with them.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7eec977d-158e-409b-a38d-5ddbda545d57)\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n- Conditional breakpoints using `Expression` evaluation.\r\n- Print breakpoints using string interpolation. Supports member and stack variables `Node {name} : {event}`.\r\n- Can disable suspending execution. Useful for print-only breakpoints.\r\n- Enable/disable or edit through the improved Breakpoint tree on the debugger's bottom panel.\r\n- Support for passing settings by command line. `-b res://script.gd:55|print=Print:%20{event}`\r\n\r\nI didn't make relevant changes in this PR for the DAP support which is used by the `godot-vscode-plugin` but the groundwork is done should someone want to implement it.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga",